==Swedish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sv|non|skjóta}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*skeutaną}}, from {{der|sv|ine-pro|*(s)kewd-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/²ɧʉːta/|lang=sv}}
* {{audio|Sv-skjuta.ogg|audio|lang=sv}}

===Verb===
{{head|sv|verb}}

# to [[shoot]]; to [[fire]]
# {{lb|sv|sports}} to [[kick]] a ball or similar; or to [[hit]] it with a stick, in order to attempt to [[score]] a goal in a sport such as [[soccer]], [[football]], [[hockey]] or similar.
# to [[push]] on an object in order to move it; to [[shove]]
# to [[protrude]], to [[extend]] (like a shoot)

